// Application manifest of the engine (asInvoker, per-monitor DPI aware: SDL3 then
// keeps the window's pixel size across displays and reports each display's scale,
// which the UI follows; the retail exe declared none). The build
// links with /MANIFEST:NO and embeds res/main.manifest from here, so the
// result does not depend on the linker's manifest-merging support.
//
// 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST.
1 24 "res/main.manifest"
